  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e23a147594446a7cdcbce3/step-5d6c3c00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Spread potato over a large microwave-safe plate. Cover with a damp paper towel. Microwave potatoes on high, 3 minutes.\n• Drain any excess liquid, then place potatoes on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then roast until golden and tender, 10-15 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e23a147594446a7cdcbce3/step-2a652910.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut apple (see ingredients) into bite-sized chunks.\n• In a large bowl, combine the honey with a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil.\n• Add apple and deluxe salad mix, tossing to combine. Season with salt and pepper to taste.\n• Little cooks: Take the lead and toss the salad!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e23a147594446a7cdcbce3/step-66112520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide plant-based crumbed chick'n, potato chunks and rainbow salad between plates. Sprinkle over Parmesan cheese.\n• Serve with creamy pesto dressing. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e23a147594446a7cdcbce3/step-86c42530.jpg"
    }
  ]
